# ⚖️ Excel vs Other Data Analytics Tools

| Tool | Best For |
|------|----------|
| Excel | Data cleaning, reporting, dashboards, ad-hoc analysis |
| SQL | Querying and managing relational databases |
| Python | Automation, advanced analytics, machine learning |
| Power BI | Interactive dashboards and business intelligence |
| Tableau | Data visualization and storytelling |

Instead of replacing each other, these tools work together.

A typical workflow looks like:

```text
SQL
   │
   ▼
Excel
   │
   ▼
Power BI
```

or

```text
SQL
   │
   ▼
Python
   │
   ▼
Power BI
```

